quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"3D打印要扩大工业应用，不能只靠打印设备，也须发展相关软件、缺陷检测技术和材料，并建立可靠的供应链。这些条件可让企业长期采用3D打印技术。 https://t.co/vNEzXuhe4A","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2113194186509889834"},{"author_id":"46574977","created_at":"2026-10-22T09:00:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113193827045413295"],"id":"2113193827045413295","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9336,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"乌克兰军方表示，其使用星链卫星受到干扰，严重影响了基辅抵御俄罗斯入侵的能力。什么是星链？乌克兰使用哪种服务？https://t.co/2x7ZlEbepj","url":"https://x.com/ChineseWSJ/status/2113193827045413295"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-22T09:00:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113193655641297228"],"id":"2113193655641297228","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":26817,"like_count":149,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":19},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2074029998751822257","type":"quoted"}],"text":"10月20日，有网友发视频称，广西横州洪灾三个多月后，部分乡镇受灾地区的清淤和救援重建工作仍主要依赖民间的志愿者团队。 https://t.co/17Rlwuzqmh https://t.co/JPoyxstElh","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113193655641297228"},{"author_id":"791197","created_at":"2026-10-22T09:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113193646891634771"],"id":"2113193646891634771","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":44,"impression_count":60248,"like_count":181,"quote_count":14,"reply_count":68,"retweet_count":28},"text":"阿富汗一名拥有58名子女、4名妻子的父亲，尽管难以负担孩子们的食物、基本照护与教育费用，仍持续扩大家庭规模。\n\n穆罕默德．萨迪克表示，由于孩子实在太多，有时甚至记不住所有人的名字。不过，他并未说明自己为何持续扩大家庭规模，也承认自己未能尽到对孩子的责任。 https://t.co/195bofEIiO","url":"https://x.com/bbcchinese/status/2113193646891634771"},{"author_id":"620632841","created_at":"2026-10-22T09:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113193645591372184"],"id":"2113193645591372184","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":17789,"like_count":28,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":5},"text":"当法国人将愤怒砸向奢侈品橱窗：奢侈品一直被当作社会和经济不公的替身。八年来巴黎第三次发生针对奢侈品牌的实体攻击，暴露了这些品牌背后隐藏的裂痕。它们在情感和心理上具有诱惑力，但在现实中遥不可及。结果，“大多数年轻一代觉得自己被排除在这个世界之外，”巴黎政治学院管理与影响力学院兼职教授","url":"https://x.com/nytchinese/status/2113193645591372184"},{"author_id":"1669276256","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:57:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113193055922921619"],"id":"2113193055922921619","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":12917,"like_count":24,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112940762291941794","type":"quoted"}],"text":"影视飓风都出海了。不过凭影视飓风这个视频质量，确实是吊打一众海外做数码测评的。\n\n但我觉着他们现在的视频没啥意思，看完以后只记得那些花里胡哨的转场和一些非常漂亮的样片\n\n就是把测评做的不像测评了，反倒是昨天看何同学的感觉不错 https://t.co/4X9oPqtJlK","url":"https://x.com/op7418/status/2113193055922921619"},{"author_id":"1416680666184306689","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:51:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113191481553080462"],"id":"2113191481553080462","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":4697,"like_count":12,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113178541407998325","type":"quoted"}],"text":"😂孙宇晨：我是马斯克、特朗普、巴菲特的合体，宾大第四巨头！\n\n在与仙道访谈的下半场，被问到人生有没有效仿对象，孙宇晨的回答是：自己的人生打法是马斯克、特朗普和巴菲特三个人的 Hybrid。\n\n三人恰好都是宾大校友，圈内戏称「宾大三巨头」，孙宇晨顺势自封第四巨头。 https://t.co/C6lyq1ij4d https://t.co/b8Y1qsPxZg","url":"https://x.com/PANewsCN/status/2113191481553080462"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:40:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113188608966607216"],"id":"2113188608966607216","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":48860,"like_count":306,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":15},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112750724115304472","type":"quoted"}],"text":"问界爆燃事故的热度压不住，就把发声的嘴封住？\n\n10月22日，搜狐汽车官方账号因发布问界爆燃事故相关内容，被禁言15天。 https://t.co/OGy0Ai3erp https://t.co/mn3BQmRUlX","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113188608966607216"},{"author_id":"1416680666184306689","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:38:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113188138172727744"],"id":"2113188138172727744","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":3991,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"👀之前火出圈的 「金明 X 孙宇晨」访谈下半场来了!\n\n速览一下，这些观点很“孙哥”👇\n\n1️⃣ 自称「宾大第四巨头」：人生打法是巴菲特、马斯克、特朗普三人的结合体。投资跟巴菲特学风控，看科技增长跟马斯克学，宣传传播跟特朗普学，英语口语就是看《飞黄腾达》（The Apprentice）练的\n\n2️⃣","url":"https://x.com/PANewsCN/status/2113188138172727744"},{"author_id":"1669276256","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:33:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113186912076980242"],"id":"2113186912076980242","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4990,"like_count":4,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113007239476977744","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Claude 里面还有一个存着的重置呢，没用的话大家可以用一下 https://t.co/4ukCnrVsSh","url":"https://x.com/op7418/status/2113186912076980242"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:32:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113186725228913052"],"id":"2113186725228913052","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":17354,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"瑞典人口仅约1000万人，人均“独角兽”企业数量却居全球前列。尚达曼总统指出，新加坡可取经的地方，不只是当地相互扶持的创业生态，也包括创业者勇于追求远大目标之余，仍坚持平等、让人人共同进步的社会文化。 https://t.co/sYKd9BbRNv","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2113186725228913052"},{"author_id":"44186175","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:31:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113186411050586345"],"id":"2113186411050586345","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":16231,"like_count":67,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":4},"text":"商业奇才。 https://t.co/v6pxxV3g9h","url":"https://x.com/xiaojingcanxue/status/2113186411050586345"},{"author_id":"1416680666184306689","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:22:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113184303727378483"],"id":"2113184303727378483","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":6848,"like_count":11,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":3},"text":"😮点石成金，变成现实了？\n\n核聚变公司 Marathon Fusion 声称用汞炼出了真金！\n\n这家旧金山核聚变初创公司表示，上个月它用聚变中子把汞变成了稳定的金，产出速率是欧洲核子研究中心（CERN）2025 年纪录的 10 倍。\n\n方法是用氘氚聚变产生的中子轰击汞-198，生成汞-197，汞-197 再衰变成金-197。","url":"https://x.com/PANewsCN/status/2113184303727378483"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:20:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113183576078385160"],"id":"2113183576078385160","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":40,"impression_count":50143,"like_count":154,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":12},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112227281846653203","type":"quoted"}],"text":"“沉浸式体验500块在上海租房，有飘窗有阳光”\n\n近日，一位沪漂网友分享他在上海花500元租的房子。他租的房在几个隔断房的其中一间，洗手间用一次2块，大床2300元/月，地铺小床300元/月，而网友租的是飘窗床，月租500元。\n\n网友评论：\n“我要是这样住，我不如买个二手五菱车住车里” https://t.co/ui1QNaYEK6 https://t.co/bBqZBtfKQf","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113183576078385160"},{"author_id":"143810986","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:17:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113183056055894186"],"id":"2113183056055894186","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":8144,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"【没有老公陪同 女性就不能出国？】\n她有护照、签证和所有必需文件。然而，孟加拉国移民局却阻止她出国。多位孟加拉国女性对DW表示，她们的婚姻状况和旅行计划遭到盘问。人权倡议者将此现象称为“道德警察”。人权组织也警告称，伊斯兰团体对女性自由施加的压力日益增加。#dwasia https://t.co/555DIXfXiJ","url":"https://x.com/dw_chinese/status/2113183056055894186"},{"author_id":"121908437","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:17:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113182824727744816"],"id":"2113182824727744816","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2723,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天的天气好得和盛夏似的，PM2.5 只有 5ug/m3 不到。 https://t.co/NtpiiNxAwz","url":"https://x.com/tualatrix/status/2113182824727744816"},{"author_id":"1416680666184306689","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:08:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113180704808870212"],"id":"2113180704808870212","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2445,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"特斯拉、英伟达合计向三星电机投资约3.7万亿韩元，锁定AI芯片基板产能\n\n据韩国《每日经济新闻》，特斯拉和英伟达将分别投